#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini.rst:7 4fd2520e818e4ba6aa9e9255006675ad
#: 539f4ea84f794b36878bdbe09b7bf2c7 5a8b029489d94380b6c435a2a0e41ed2
#: 690f037255034f468ce3df8bdbeadac0 be00fb1b46034ff0b8689da2d81a9ca1
#: fa55b1385d5f4d29bf31760a3c8e6b9b
msgid ""
"The `PXFmini (Pixhawk Fire Cape Mini) Autopilot Shield "
"<https://erlerobotics.com/blog/pxfmini/>`__ made by `Erle Robotics "
"<https://erlerobotics.com/>`__ is a low cost and open autopilot shield for "
"the Raspberry Pi that allows you to create a ready-to-fly autopilot with "
"support for ArduPilot. The shield has been designed specially for the "
"Raspberry Pi Zero but it is also pin to pin compatible with other models "
"from the Raspberry Pi family."
msgstr ""
"`PXFmini（Pixhawk Fire Cape Mini）飞控扩展板 "
"<https://erlerobotics.com/blog/pxfmini/>`__ 由 `Erle Robotics "
"<https://erlerobotics.com/>`__ 制造，是一款低成本开源 Raspberry Pi 飞控扩展板，支持 "
"ArduPilot，可构建即飞飞控。该扩展板专为 Raspberry Pi Zero 设计，但也与 Raspberry Pi 家族其他型号引脚兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini.rst:17 10b64c3b1c1846f6a6788f07f32eeed8
#: 46a08ce2742741e9847ecc9c66b0acd3 6ce604aa0f044c9388328d9fdbf2321e
#: ab795d6203b14a5a87c196de11ae405e ddea58dda3cc454cb7fde8d8e581384e
#: eb7cbe93d6e940fd8f78fd0178a26b64
msgid ""
"The PXFmini shield weighs only 15 grams and embeds all the power electronics"
" necessary to comply with most of the existing components for drones through"
" its I2C and UART ports. PXFmini includes 3 axes gravity sensor, 3 axes "
"gyroscope, 3 axes digital compass, pressure sensor, temperature sensor and "
"an ADC. It includes new JST GH connectors provide an amazing new experience."
msgstr ""
"PXFmini 扩展板重量仅 15 克，集成了通过 I2C 和 UART 接口与大多数现有无人机组件兼容所需的全部电源电子器件。PXFmini "
"包含三轴重力传感器、三轴陀螺仪、三轴数字罗盘、气压传感器、温度传感器和 ADC，并配备全新 JST GH 连接器，带来出色的使用体验。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-pxfmini.rst:24 26a5ad2792234e0093af2e07d165bfa4
#: 33317eb2b9ce43899cf9d8ac819412ea 4b74d7dc3dbf44a69b5ed1f35ce5557c
#: 801240e05b8646ac9d323180f6ad789a a308d8d3021c4b34812b7694e3a164bd
#: a5db42cdca9945f49657794087a8ea8c
msgid ""
"What's best, the PXFmini schematics are open for you to hack around and "
"create your own robots based on the design. The board can be purchased `here"
" <https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/pxfmini/>`__."
msgstr ""
"更棒的是，PXFmini 的原理图是开源的，您可以基于该设计进行二次开发，制作自己的机器人。开发板可在 `此处 "
"<https://erlerobotics.com/blog/product/pxfmini/>`__ 购买。"

